paper_formatting_concerns.value:
1) Typesetting mistakes (e.g. period missing after eq. 1, 2, 6; no commas before "where");
2) Ambigous statements (l101: "is parameterized/learned" - which one?);
3) The titles of the paper are not on the same level of abstraction (1 Introduction, 2 Preliminaries 3 Strong and Weak forms 4 How to learn Quadrature Rules? -> 1,2, are classical structure, which means 3 should be something like "main part").
4) Mix of italiqe, bold, and both for emphasis, without a clear reason to switch from one to the other. 
5) Use of color in the text (l199, 203) is very uncommon.
6) Table formatting is not using NeurIPS style (e.g. table 7,8, wrong caption placement and vertical bars).

